# generated
# results/ holds RAW solver output - large, regenerable, and needing two commercial
# licences to reproduce. results/clean/ is the tidy version and IS committed: it is the
# deliberate exception of Part 1 rule 5, because it is what the notebooks and figures
# read, and without it nothing in this repository works from a clean clone.
results/**
!results/.gitkeep
!results/clean/
!results/clean/**
__pycache__/
*.pyc

